# Per-Dockerfile ignore for tenebris-rs/Dockerfile (BuildKit prefers
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over <context>/.dockerignore). The build
# context is the repo root; whitelist only what the build copies so
# the JS tree, the C build dirs, third_party vendors, and the local
# cargo target/ never get shipped to the builder.
*
!tenebris-rs/Cargo.toml
!tenebris-rs/Cargo.lock
!tenebris-rs/crates
!tenebris-c/assets/config

# Belt and braces: never let local build output inside crates/ ride
# along even if one appears there.
tenebris-rs/crates/**/target
